{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act30side_level_act30side_03_end",
  "groupId": "act30side",
  "stageId": "act30side_03",
  "title": "臨時停車",
  "storyCode": "RS-3",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "26087d90edb2d42f05b01d43562a74bc58dffc70dc3dbf3a4d1ce67599a0df66",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "羅莎琳，來，媽媽教你怎麼向耶拉岡德禱告。\n閉上眼睛，把手放在胸前，在心裡呼喊耶拉岡德的名字……\n對啦，我們的小羅莎琳真棒，做得很好。\n羅莎琳，你知道嗎，你是爸爸媽媽最最重要的寶貝。\n不管旁人怎麼說，媽媽都不後悔生下你。\n願耶拉岡德保佑……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "這耶拉岡德像，走近了看，感覺更大了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "耶拉岡德，原來就長這樣啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "耶拉岡德……祈禱……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "媽媽當時好像還說了什麼，呃呃呃，還有什麼來著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "不行，頭痛，想不起來，都是三歲之前的事了，想不起來也很正常吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "總之先祈禱——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "要閉眼，然後手……手怎麼放來著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "將右手平展，置於胸前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "在耶拉岡德面前，閉上我們無能洞真的雙眼，垂下我們過於驕傲的頭顱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "去除心中雜念，默頌耶拉岡德之名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "孩子，來，跟著我一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "……哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "烈夏重新閉上眼睛。\n視線被遮蔽，四周陷入黑暗，感知卻彷彿在剎那間寬闊延展。\n身後的老修士用沙啞的聲音唱誦對耶拉岡德的讚美——\n耶拉岡德，予我們飽腹的山泉與果樹。\n耶拉岡德，予我們冰凍天災的風雪。\n善良慈愛的耶拉岡德，保佑我們，保佑謝拉格。\n在頌聲中，風刮過臉頰的觸感被放大，耳畔的風雪聲呼呼作響。\n不知從何而起的熟悉感幾乎要將烈夏再度拉入回憶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "（耶拉岡德……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "（我不是你的信徒，我也不需要你的保佑。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "（但如果你真能保佑你的信徒，那你一定要保佑我媽。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "（如果不是我媽的要求，我可不會來。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "嗯，不行，這樣不夠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "什麼……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "耶拉岡德！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "耶拉岡德——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "請你保佑我媽媽！她是你的信徒！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "她跟我說謝拉格很好——！我會自己去看看到底有多好——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吃驚的遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_523_1",
      "text": "那是在喊什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "興奮的遊客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "好像是在祈禱？原來謝拉格的祈禱是這樣的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "呼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "好，這樣就沒問題了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "孩子，你這是做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "這還用問，當然是祈禱啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我覺得吧，在心裡祈禱不如直接喊出來，都在心裡念完了，萬一耶拉岡德聽不到怎辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "這……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "難得來一次，當然要不留遺憾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "對了，剛剛多謝你教我啊，老伯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "唉，罷了，想來耶拉岡德也不會在意這些細枝末節……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "小妹妹不必客氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "哈哈哈，那耶拉岡德還蠻開明的嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "老伯你也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "將一直放在胸前的手垂下，女孩最後抬頭望了一眼面前高大的耶拉岡德像，轉身走下台階。\n隨著她的轉身，年老的修士終於看清女孩的面容。\n日光描摹面前的這副眉眼。\n臉頰的弧度，鼻樑的聳起，唇瓣的形狀……\n——難以言說的熟悉感瞬間將老人淹沒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "你、你是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "嗯？怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "不、不，沒什麼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "老頭子見過的遊客不算少了，但像小妹妹你這般行事的，還是頭一回見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "這樣嗎？我覺得我好像也沒幹嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "……小妹妹，妳叫什麼名字？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "羅莎琳，我叫羅莎琳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "……羅莎琳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "那你，多大年紀了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我？我就快二十了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "你可是謝拉格人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "老伯，你看得出來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "我一看你，就覺得像……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "像、像啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "那你看得還挺準，我確實是在謝拉格出生的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "不過，我之前一直跟著我媽在烏薩斯生活，這還是頭一次來謝拉格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "嗯……這麼算的話，只能勉強算半個謝拉格人吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "你在烏薩斯長大？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "……烏薩斯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "烏薩斯也挺好，挺好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "那小妹妹你這次來謝拉格，有何打算？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "行，我知道了。繼續忙你們的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "不，這樣就足夠了，做多了反而讓人起疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "那個孩子？說來話長，等之後吃飯的時候我再告訴你。掛了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "滿意了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "暫時就這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "text": "你確定“灰禮帽”真的沒有發現別的東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "別大驚小怪，諾希斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "如果到了你想的那一步，那位公爵閣下不可能還像現在一樣坐得住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "別忘了那些駐紮在山腳下的軍隊，克雷加文不是吃素的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "text": "但“灰禮帽”能出現在車上……明顯是他們已經嗅到了些什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "text": "“灰禮帽”。我接觸過，看似都是些油腔滑調的貴族僕役，實際上呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "text": "他們是吃著一個帝國留下的戰爭餘燼長大的。麻煩得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "難道不是你們兩個平日作惡多端，現在報應來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "text": "呵，報應？那你也跑不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "誰說不是呢，把一個小女孩送去維多利亞的間諜跟前，我們當然會遭報應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "那個小女孩會把“灰禮帽”引開。所以我們才更要讓維多利亞人相信，她是個“重要人物”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "text": "我還是要提醒你，耶拉岡德像落成，儀式即將舉行，這段時間所有人的目光都將聚集於此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "text": "我們都需要更加小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "還輪不到你來提醒我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "放心吧，我不會大意的。畢竟這次不是什麼過家家，就算現在我布朗陶家心生悔意想要退出，恐怕也不成了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "不對，應該說……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "今天我若和你諾希斯吐露半點退意，明天，恐怕我就要“出點意外”了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "text": "……不必假設這種沒有可能性的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "text": "事關謝拉格，我們只能往前，絕不能後退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "好吧，但諾希斯，我們不可能一直瞞下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "這麼大的工程，牽動了太多東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "“灰禮帽”今天沒有遇到那個女孩，明天也會撞到某個男孩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "他總會嗅到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "恩希歐迪斯最好是已經有所打算，要不然，就算聖女大人代表整個謝拉格出面，也根本保不住他"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "不，也許維多利亞反而更重視喀蘭貿易呢？那可就真的沒有底牌了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鐧",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "text": "聖女和恩希歐迪斯在立場上分割對立，對我們哪邊都好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "……唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "看來我明天的家庭聚餐要泡湯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "諾希斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_206_gnosis_1",
      "text": "你什麼時候這麼重視家庭了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "謝拉格不一直都很重視這些嗎？家族，血統，雖然有些迂腐，不過……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菈塔托絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_253_1",
      "text": "聖女和恩希歐迪斯，本來也是一對兄妹吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "竟然是如此……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "你的母親在謝拉格生下你，又在你年幼時帶著你離開，定居烏薩斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "此番你千里迢迢回來，不論是於耶拉岡德像前祈禱，還是準備登上雪山，竟都只是為了完成母親的心願。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "竟是……如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "差不多就是這麼回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "真是個好孩子……是個好孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "有膽有識，聰明機靈，長得也好看……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "嘿，嘿嘿，真的有老伯你誇的那麼好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "怎麼沒有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "哪家能有你這樣的好孩子，是耶拉岡德保佑，上輩子積攢的福氣……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "那是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "哎也不對，只能說是我媽有福氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "跟我那個有和沒有沒什麼兩樣的爸爸可沒什麼關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "咳嗯，唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "你父，唉，你父親這事……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "連老伯你也想不出會是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "唉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "奇怪了，不應該啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "謝拉格排得上號的美男子，再加上我媽說我和我爹長得還挺像，我本以為應該不難找才對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "難道說……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "難道說，其實我爸根本長得一般，只是情人眼裡出帥哥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "這……不會如此，你想歪了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "哇！老伯你這麼激動幹嘛，嚇我一跳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "不會嗎？我倒覺得還挺有可能的，不然說不通了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "……唉，難啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "難就難吧，這事不急，回頭再說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "老伯，既然你是這裡的修士，應該對這附近很熟悉吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "不敢說萬事皆知，不過略知一二。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "那就是知道的意思囉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "那我能問問旁邊那座山該從哪上山嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我聽說那上頭還是個受情侶歡迎的小景點，我要是想上山，要不要買門票？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "自然不用什麼門票。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "除去聖山有聖女大人坐鎮，意義特殊，謝拉格的山川皆歸屬所有耶拉岡德的子民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "唉，放在從前，誰會在謝拉格問出這種問題？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "那時候，我們這比現在要安靜多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "沒有那些什麼景點、什麼噱頭，也沒有那麼多遊客，人人心有信仰，敬愛山川湖泊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "也就是如今希瓦艾什家一意主張開放，聖女大人也不阻攔，才會如此……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "開放不好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "……這已經不是老頭子能評判的囉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "小妹妹，你打算今日便上山去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "唔，今天有點晚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "今天先找個地方休息一晚上，明天一早我就上山。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "老伯，這附近有沒有什麼推薦的旅館？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "老頭子家裡倒是有幾間陋屋，還算可遮風避雨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "小妹妹你若是不嫌棄……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "不嫌棄！我跟你走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "老伯你人真好！我媽說謝拉格民風淳樸，看來她沒騙我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "你、你這孩子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "怎麼能這麼快答應下來？你這以後出門在外，這麼不注意怎麼可以？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "萬一有人起了歹心，你該如何是好？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "這不是你自己提出來的嘛，怎麼反而還生氣了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "放心吧，老伯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我在烏薩斯吃的苦也不少，沒那麼容易被欺負，真要說，還不知道誰打得過誰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "歪理！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "若旁人比你強，你又要如何自保？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "我也沒那麼傻……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "好了，知道老伯你是擔心我了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "其實，我也不知道為什麼，但總覺得，呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老修士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1160_1",
      "text": "吞吞吐吐的做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "唉，說不清怎麼回事，反正我就是覺得……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "text": "老伯你，肯定不會害我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "身手矯健的山雪鬼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_275",
      "text": "怎麼樣？找到目標了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬥志昂揚的山雪鬼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_275",
      "text": "沒。用望遠鏡看了一圈，那座湖心島上本來就沒什麼人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "身手矯健的山雪鬼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_275",
      "text": "我猜也是。對方是偽裝大師，不會讓我們輕易發現的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬥志昂揚的山雪鬼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_275",
      "text": "那你讓我看個屁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "身手矯健的山雪鬼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_275",
      "text": "萬一呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "身手矯健的山雪鬼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_275",
      "text": "反正我們的任務是跟著這個小女孩，別讓她遇到危險，而且還不能被她發現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "山雪鬼的反偵察技術還是有待提升。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不過，既然那個女孩已經遇見了佩爾羅契家的老家主……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而且，連山雪鬼都來了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什麼東西——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬥志昂揚的山雪鬼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_275",
      "text": "什麼動靜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "身手矯健的山雪鬼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_275",
      "text": "我去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（馱獸的叫聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "身手矯健的山雪鬼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_275",
      "text": "原來是野生馱獸啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "……看來多學點東西，總是會在意想不到的時候派上用場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“灰禮帽”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_867_1",
      "text": "嘶——我的腰——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "你看，恩雅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "你再仔細看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "這雕像……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "果然還是不太合適吧，和耶拉岡德根本不像！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "會嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "我覺得還好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "一點都不好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "至少臉也該再瘦一些，身材也……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "好了，雅兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "這是謝拉格人民所做的選擇，現在建成的耶拉岡德像，就是他們心目中最神聖的耶拉岡德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "你知道的，在這方面，不可能再有太大改動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "別唉聲嘆氣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "雅兒，剛剛那個女孩說的你聽見了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "你說那個大嗓門的丫頭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "當然聽見了，那丫頭還挺有趣，話說得倒還有幾分道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "在心中祈禱的話，就算是耶拉岡德，也做不到讀心啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "雅兒……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "更遑論人的心思如此複雜，若是不將自己所求訴之於口，誰又會知道呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "確實如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "所以說啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "聖女大人，也請聽聽您侍女小小的願望吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "這雕像——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "駁回。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雅兒",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_250_1",
      "text": "恩雅，好恩雅~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "text": "這樣撒嬌也不行哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
